OL,3,GNEWSABridge is back in place after
OL,4,Amajor refurbishment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bridge has been lifted back into
OL,7,Fplace after undergoing a full
OL,8,Frefurbishment.
OL,10,FThe 73-year-old Weel Bridge, which
OL,11,Fcarries traffic over the River Hull
OL,12,Fnear Beverley, East Yorkshire, was
OL,13,Ftaken to an engineering firm in South
OL,14,FYorkshire in April for the work.
OL,16,FThe structure has been strengthened and
OL,17,Fhas undergone structural repairs, had
OL,18,Fits footpath widened, and been given
OL,19,Fupgrades to its mechanical, electrical
OL,20,Fand bridge control systems.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
